__TOC__

All commands are slash commands.

== Core ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Command !! Description
|-
| <code>/work</code> || Claim daily Molgium salary.
|-
| <code>/job list</code> || Show job progression options.
|-
| <code>/job apply id:&lt;1|2|3&gt;</code> || Apply for a job tier (salary upgrade).
|-
| <code>/profile</code> || View your profile.
|-
| <code>/profile user:@user</code> || View another user’s profile.
|-
| <code>/leaderboard mode:&lt;richest|most_eggs_hatched|most_mythics|top_fish_value&gt;</code> || View leaderboards.
|}

== Shop and Loadout ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Command !! Description
|-
| <code>/shop</code> || Show shop and daily rotation.
|-
| <code>/shop buy_id:&lt;cosmetic_id&gt;</code> || Buy a rotating cosmetic.
|-
| <code>/loadout view</code> || View active loadout.
|-
| <code>/loadout set title id:&lt;id&gt;</code> || Set title cosmetic.
|-
| <code>/loadout set badge id:&lt;id&gt;</code> || Set badge cosmetic.
|-
| <code>/loadout set frame id:&lt;id&gt;</code> || Set frame cosmetic.
|}

