== Moderation/Admin ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Command !! Description
|-
| <code>/purge amount:&lt;1-100&gt;</code> || Delete recent + old messages (pinned skipped).
|-
| <code>/admin give-molgium user:@user amount:&lt;n&gt;</code> || Give currency.
|-
| <code>/admin give-egg user:@user amount:&lt;n&gt;</code> || Give eggs.
|-
| <code>/admin force-event name:&lt;event&gt;</code> || Trigger event manually.
|-
| <code>/admin set-treasury amount:&lt;n&gt;</code> || Set Treasury value.
|-
| <code>/admin post-citizens-panel</code> || Post/refresh Citizens role panel in Immigration-Center.
|}

